(LEGAL-011 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: G.O. \(Ms\) No. 540, Revenue \(LD6\(2\)\) Department  Three-Tier Grievance Redre) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Tahsildar \(Original Petition\), RDO \(Appellate Committee\), District Collector \(Review Committee\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Para 4\(i\) \(30-Day Statutory Timeframe for Original Petitions\)) Tj T*
(Upon receipt of a written petition alleging encroachment in a water body or tank,) Tj T*
(the Tahsildar / Competent WRD Authority shall conduct a field survey, hear the) Tj T*
(parties, and complete eviction action within 30 days, communicating a speaking) Tj T*
(order to the petitioner.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Para 4\(ii\)-\(iii\) \(Divisional Appellate & District Review Committees\)) Tj T*
(If no action is taken within 30 days, the petitioner may file an appeal before the) Tj T*
(Divisional Appellate Committee chaired by the Revenue Divisional Officer \(RDO\)) Tj T*
(\(20-day limit\), and a further review before the District Review Committee chaired) Tj T*
(by the District Collector.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
